WHY THIS IS NOT AN OPEN LICENCE

The repository carries product photography belonging to Audeze LLC and its
parent company. Those images are held here as development reference. They are
not ours to license, and an open licence would have purported to pass rights in
them to everyone who cloned the repository - rights that were never ours to
give. Nothing in this notice grants any right to that material.

The Audeze and Maxwell names are used only to identify the hardware this
software talks to. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by Audeze LLC or Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc.
